      "refersTo": "next-room-field",
      "description": "Signature: greeting, next room at display size, and the start button on a tinted blue field.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-root\"><section class=\"ds-next\"><div><p class=\"ds-greet\">Cześć, uidemo. Wracasz do ścieżki Web Security, następny pokój to:</p><h2 class=\"ds-next-title\">SQL Injection: UNION</h2><p class=\"ds-next-meta\">Pokój 4 z 9</p></div><button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-primary\">Wejdź do pokoju</button></section></div>",
      "css": ".ds-root{--ud-blue:#0b63ff;--ud-blue-ink:#fff;--ud-cta-hover:#4a8dff;--ud-surface:#151f30;--ud-surface-2:#1c2840;--ud-board:#0b111c;--ud-ink:#e8edf5;--ud-muted:#9eabbf;--ud-track:#26344f;--ud-link:#6ea2ff;--ud-xp:#2fd0b0;--ud-hero-bg:#142a52;--ud-hero-ink:#fff;--ud-hero-muted:#c3d3ef;--ud-tip-bg:#1f2b42;--ud-peek-chip:#2c3a55;--ud-radius:6px;--ud-ease:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--ud-float-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08),0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ud-ink);} .ds-next{background:var(--ud-hero-bg);color:var(--ud-hero-ink);border-radius:var(--ud-radius);padding:32px 36px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px 40px;} .ds-greet{margin:0 0 10px;color:var(--ud-hero-muted);font-size:1.0625rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;} .ds-next-title{margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.25rem,1.4rem + 2.6vw,3.5rem);font-weight:800;font-stretch:85%;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;} .ds-next-meta{margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--ud-hero-muted);} .ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:48px;padding:0 24px;border:0;border-radius:var(--ud-radius);font:inherit;font-weight:650;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;transition:transform 160ms var(--ud-ease),background-color 160ms var(--ud-ease);} .ds-btn-primary{background:var(--ud-blue);color:var(--ud-blue-ink);} .ds-btn-primary:hover{background:var(--ud-cta-hover);transform:translateY(-1px);} .ds-btn:active{transform:translateY(1px);} .ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ud-link);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Path Rail",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "path-rail",
      "description": "Signature: one segment per room, teal solved, blue current, track for the rest.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-root\"><div class=\"ds-rail\"><span class=\"is-done\"></span><span class=\"is-done\"></span><span class=\"is-done\"></span><span class=\"is-current\"></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-root{--ud-blue:#0b63ff;--ud-blue-ink:#fff;--ud-cta-hover:#4a8dff;--ud-surface:#151f30;--ud-surface-2:#1c2840;--ud-board:#0b111c;--ud-ink:#e8edf5;--ud-muted:#9eabbf;--ud-track:#26344f;--ud-link:#6ea2ff;--ud-xp:#2fd0b0;--ud-hero-bg:#142a52;--ud-hero-ink:#fff;--ud-hero-muted:#c3d3ef;--ud-tip-bg:#1f2b42;--ud-peek-chip:#2c3a55;--ud-radius:6px;--ud-ease:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--ud-float-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08),0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ud-ink);} .ds-rail{display:grid;grid-auto-flow:column;grid-auto-columns:1fr;gap:4px;width:420px;} .ds-rail span{height:10px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ud-track);} .ds-rail span.is-done{background:var(--ud-xp);} .ds-rail span.is-current{background:var(--ud-blue);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Standings Window",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "standings-card",
      "description": "Signature: ranking rows on the board step, the learner's own row in solid brand blue.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-root\"><ol class=\"ds-standings\"><li><span class=\"ds-pos\">4</span><span>m4rek</span><span class=\"ds-pts\">680 XP</span></li><li class=\"is-me\"><span class=\"ds-pos\">5</span><span>uidemo</span><span class=\"ds-pts\">640 XP</span></li><li><span class=\"ds-pos\">6</span><span>bajtek</span><span class=\"ds-pts\">610 XP</span></li></ol></div>",
      "css": ".ds-root{--ud-blue:#0b63ff;--ud-blue-ink:#fff;--ud-cta-hover:#4a8dff;--ud-surface:#151f30;--ud-surface-2:#1c2840;--ud-board:#0b111c;--ud-ink:#e8edf5;--ud-muted:#9eabbf;--ud-track:#26344f;--ud-link:#6ea2ff;--ud-xp:#2fd0b0;--ud-hero-bg:#142a52;--ud-hero-ink:#fff;--ud-hero-muted:#c3d3ef;--ud-tip-bg:#1f2b42;--ud-peek-chip:#2c3a55;--ud-radius:6px;--ud-ease:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--ud-float-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08),0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ud-ink);} .ds-standings{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:20px 12px;width:340px;background:var(--ud-board);border-radius:var(--ud-radius);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;} .ds-standings li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:36px minmax(0,1fr) auto;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:var(--ud-radius);} .ds-standings li.is-me{background:var(--ud-blue);color:var(--ud-blue-ink);font-weight:700;} .ds-pos,.ds-pts{font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:750;font-stretch:75%;} .ds-pos{color:var(--ud-muted);} .ds-standings li.is-me .ds-pos{color:inherit;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Term Tooltip",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "floating-card",
      "description": "Dotted-underlined term revealing a floating explanation on hover or focus.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-root\"><span class=\"ds-term\"><button class=\"ds-term-btn\">Elo 1184 <svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"8\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"7\" width=\"2\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#0b111c\"/><rect x=\"7\" y=\"4\" width=\"2\" height=\"2\" fill=\"#0b111c\"/></svg></button><span class=\"ds-tip\" role=\"tooltip\"><strong>Elo</strong>Ocena z pojedynków w Arenie.</span></span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-root{--ud-blue:#0b63ff;--ud-blue-ink:#fff;--ud-cta-hover:#4a8dff;--ud-surface:#151f30;--ud-surface-2:#1c2840;--ud-board:#0b111c;--ud-ink:#e8edf5;--ud-muted:#9eabbf;--ud-track:#26344f;--ud-link:#6ea2ff;--ud-xp:#2fd0b0;--ud-hero-bg:#142a52;--ud-hero-ink:#fff;--ud-hero-muted:#c3d3ef;--ud-tip-bg:#1f2b42;--ud-peek-chip:#2c3a55;--ud-radius:6px;--ud-ease:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--ud-float-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08),0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ud-ink);} .ds-term{position:relative;display:inline-block;} .ds-term-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:0;border:0;background:none;color:var(--ud-ink);font:inherit;font-weight:650;cursor:help;text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration-color:var(--ud-muted);text-underline-offset:4px;} .ds-term-btn svg{color:var(--ud-link);} .ds-term-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ud-link);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:6px;} .ds-tip{position:absolute;left:0;top:calc(100% + 10px);width:260px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:var(--ud-radius);background:var(--ud-tip-bg);color:var(--ud-ink);font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.5;box-shadow:var(--ud-float-shadow);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(-4px);transition:opacity 140ms var(--ud-ease),transform 140ms var(--ud-ease),visibility 0s linear 140ms;} .ds-tip strong{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;} .ds-term:hover .ds-tip,.ds-term:focus-within .ds-tip{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none;transition-delay:0s;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Recommended Path Card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "recommended-card",
      "description": "Blue-wash card in the standings column with a small solid-blue call to action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-root\"><a class=\"ds-reco\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-reco-title\">Web Security</span><span class=\"ds-reco-desc\">Od żądań HTTP po SQL injection, XSS i SSRF.</span><span class=\"ds-reco-foot\"><span class=\"ds-reco-meta\">Polecana, 9 pokoi</span><span class=\"ds-reco-cta\">Zobacz ścieżkę</span></span></a></div>",
      "css": ".ds-root{--ud-blue:#0b63ff;--ud-blue-ink:#fff;--ud-cta-hover:#4a8dff;--ud-surface:#151f30;--ud-surface-2:#1c2840;--ud-board:#0b111c;--ud-ink:#e8edf5;--ud-muted:#9eabbf;--ud-track:#26344f;--ud-link:#6ea2ff;--ud-xp:#2fd0b0;--ud-hero-bg:#142a52;--ud-hero-ink:#fff;--ud-hero-muted:#c3d3ef;--ud-tip-bg:#1f2b42;--ud-peek-chip:#2c3a55;--ud-radius:6px;--ud-ease:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);--ud-float-shadow:0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08),0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--ud-ink);} .ds-reco{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;width:300px;padding:20px;border-radius:var(--ud-radius);background:rgba(11,99,255,0.18);color:var(--ud-ink);text-decoration:none;} .ds-reco:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ud-link);outline-offset:3px;} .ds-reco-title{font-size:1.375rem;font-weight:800;font-stretch:85%;line-height:1.15;} .ds-reco-desc{color:var(--ud-muted);} .ds-reco-foot{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;} .ds-reco-meta{color:var(--ud-muted);font-size:0.875rem;} .ds-reco-cta{padding:7px 14px;border-radius:var(--ud-radius);background:var(--ud-blue);color:var(--ud-blue-ink);font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:650;transition:background-color 160ms var(--ud-ease),transform 160ms var(--ud-ease);} .ds-reco:hover .ds-reco-cta,.ds-reco:focus-visible .ds-reco-cta{background:var(--ud-cta-hover);transform:translateY(-1px);}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Scoreboard",
    "overview": "Learning and competition sit side by side as one scoreboard. The left column is the learner's own track: the next room in a blue-tinted field, the path as a segmented rail, level and recent flags, friends. The right column is the standings card: a huge condensed rank number, the XP gap to the place above with a bar, a window of the ranking with the learner's row filled in brand blue, and a recommended path. Neither half hides the other.\n\nThe world is flat and tonal. Depth comes from stepping the navy ground through a few surface tones, never from resting shadows or gradients. One typeface, Archivo, carries everything; its width axis does the expressive work: condensed and heavy for numerals, ranks and room names, normal width for reading text. Numbers are tabular everywhere so scores line up.\n\nColour is functional. Brand blue `#0b63ff` marks action and the learner's own position; teal marks captured XP and completion; the four difficulty colours appear only as state text. Dark and light themes are both first-class and share every rule; only values change.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Two-column scoreboard split: fluid learning column, 380px sticky standings card.",
      "Flat tonal layering; shadows only on floating overlays.",
      "Archivo only, with width (wdth 70 to 100) as the hierarchy tool.",
      "Brand blue reserved for actions, progress fill and \"you are here\".",
      "Tabular numerals throughout.",
      "Full parity between dark and light themes."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Blue Means Go Rule",
        "body": "Brand blue is a solid fill only for an action, a progress fill, or the learner's own position. Large informational fields get the tinted `next-field` or `blue-soft`, never solid brand blue.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Teal Is Earned Rule",
        "body": "Teal appears only for XP gained and rooms completed. Never decorate with it.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The State-Only Difficulty Rule",
        "body": "Difficulty colours are text colour on a label, never a background, border or badge fill.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Width Is Hierarchy Rule",
        "body": "Emphasis on numbers and names comes from narrowing the width axis plus weight, not from a second typeface. Reading text stays at normal width.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Rule",
        "body": "`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` is set on the whole surface. Scores must align in columns.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No Tracked Caps Rule",
        "body": "Headings and labels are sentence case with normal or negative tracking. The surface resets letter-spacing to normal on headings and buttons.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tonal Step Rule",
        "body": "A container separates from its parent by a surface step, never by a shadow or a border.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Only Things That Float Rule",
        "body": "A shadow means the element is floating above the page (tooltip, preview). If it is in the flow, it is flat.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep brand blue (`#0b63ff`) as a solid fill only for actions, progress fills and the learner's own row.",
      "**Do** put large highlighted blocks on a tinted field (`next-field`, `blue-soft`) so the button inside stays the loudest element.",
      "**Do** separate containers by tonal surface steps (ground, surface, raised surface, board).",
      "**Do** set numerals in condensed, heavy Archivo (width 70 to 85%, weight 750 to 800) with tabular figures.",
      "**Do** define every colour for both dark and light themes, and check contrast in both.",
      "**Do** use 6px corners for containers and controls, 4px for chips, full circles only for avatars.",
      "**Do** use the 160ms `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` transition for hover fills, and disable motion under reduced-motion."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** add resting shadows or borders to cards; the floating overlay shadow is for tooltips and previews only.",
      "**Don't** use gradients on surfaces, buttons or text.",
      "**Don't** use difficulty colours as backgrounds or badge fills; they are label text.",
      "**Don't** add a second typeface; vary Archivo's width and weight instead.",
      "**Don't** set headings or labels in tracked uppercase.",
      "**Don't** use decorative icon tiles (an icon in a coloured square or circle); state marks stay small, bare and coloured by state, and icons inside buttons only accompany a text label."
    ]
  }
}
